  "pr": {
    "description": "### Overview\\nPR 1 of BRIEF-21 (delta view over the read API — plan: \`docs/plans/brief-21-delta-view.md\`). Pure read-side: the worker already warms delta cores per checkpoint SHA; this exposes them and derives the reviewer-personal \\"since my last review\\" comparison.\\n\\nNote: local \`main\` is one docs commit ahead of \`origin/main\` (\`bb6d7a7\` — the BRIEF-21 plan); the PR diff includes it until that is pushed.\\n\\n### Changelog\\n- **persistence:** lean \`deltas.existsForSpan\` availability probe (mirrors the marks/narrative probes — never loads the body).\\n- **api:** \`GET /api/repos/:repoId/pulls/:prNumber/delta?baseline&head\` behind the existing per-repo authz gate — Zod-validated span (no-\`:\` rule shared with the diff route), 404 collapse identical to the sibling artifact reads, body served as stored, \`no-store\`.\\n- **api:** PR-meta grows \`comparisons.lastReview\`, a per-reviewer union derived from the requesting session's \`checkpoint\` row:\\n  - marks exist → \`{ deltaAvailable, baselineSha, baselineIndex? }\` (marks-only is an OFFER — the worker skips the delta core on huge spans, absence is the signal);\\n  - no marks + non-terminal delta generation for the exact span → \`{ unavailable: \\"pending\\" }\`;\\n  - no marks otherwise → \`{ unavailable: \\"baseline-unavailable\\" }\`;\\n  - field ABSENT when the reviewer never submitted, no brief/head exists, or the checkpoint IS the current head (empty span — nothing to compare; a judgment call beyond the plan's letter, flagged for review).\\n  - Reason vocab is API-layer only (\`as const\` + \`ValueOf\`) — never stored, no DB migration.\\n- **fold-in (BRIEF-19 follow-up, decided at the LOC gate):** nullable \`pull_request.base_sha\` + migration 0006; refreshed by both upsert paths from \`pull_request\` events, preserved when a review event omits it; PR-meta \`baseSha\` falls back to the row so the span is known before any brief lands.\\n\\n### Tests\\n- persistence: \`existsForSpan\` reflect/lean/tenancy; \`base_sha\` refresh/preserve on both upsert paths.\\n- api: delta GET 200/404/400 (+ cross-repo \`:\` rejection, authz positive-cache interplay); \`lastReview\` — absent without checkpoint, own-checkpoint scoping (another reviewer / another tenant never drives it), marks-only vs marks+delta tiers, pending vs baseline-unavailable split (incl. terminal-failure flip-back), empty-span absence; PR-meta \`baseSha\` pre-brief.\\n\\nHand-written diff ≈ 458 LOC (the rest is the generated drizzle snapshot). Compose smoke deferred to the stack's end-to-end pass (checkpoint rows need hand-seeding until BRIEF-23).",
